        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The main idea is the same: when you activate each cell in the game field, it changes the colors of the cell and any adjacent cells in a straight line. Each cell switches between three different colors, and your task is to make them all match the same color.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La idea principal es la misma: al activar cada celda del campo de juego, cambia el color de esa celda y el de las celdas contiguas en línea recta. Cada celda alterna entre tres colores distintos, y tu tarea es hacer que todas coincidan en el mismo color.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2018",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
